---
import PerformanceShowcase from "../components/PerformanceShowcase.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import CampaignEvidence from "../components/CampaignEvidence.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Performance Marketing Agency" description="LeadsFlo plans and manages Google Ads and Meta Ads with landing page alignment, conversion tracking and lead-quality feedback." path="/performance-marketing/">
<section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker">01 / PERFORMANCE MARKETING</p><h1>Paid media that starts with the right lead.</h1><p class="lf-lede">Google Ads and Meta Ads can create demand, but clicks alone do not grow a business. We connect targeting, offers, landing pages and measurement so campaigns are accountable to qualified inquiries and sales conversations.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your goals <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><aside class="lf-hero-aside"><span>WHY IT MATTERS</span><strong>For businesses that need a more predictable way to attract relevant prospects.</strong><span class="lf-aside-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></aside></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">THE CAPABILITIES</p><h2>Channels and campaign capabilities.</h2></div><div class="lf-detail-grid"><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">01</span><h3>Google Search Ads</h3><p>Capture existing demand from people actively searching for your services. We structure campaigns around search intent, clear offers and relevant landing pages.</p></article>
<article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">02</span><h3>Meta Ads</h3><p>Reach potential customers on Facebook and Instagram using audience research, strong messaging and multiple creative angles.</p></article>
<article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">03</span><h3>Measurement &amp; optimization</h3><p>Track lead submissions, meaningful contact events and downstream quality signals where your systems allow it.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-editorial-section" aria-label="What your campaigns include."><div class="container"><div class="lf-editorial-head"><p class="section-kicker">FROM AD SPEND TO OPPORTUNITY</p><h2>What your campaigns include.</h2></div><div class="lf-editorial-grid"><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>01 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Account and offer review</h3><p>We assess the service offer, target locations, existing conversion data, campaign structure and how leads are currently handled.</p></article><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>02 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Campaign and measurement setup</h3><p>Search intent and negative keywords for Google; audiences, creative angles and messaging for Meta; relevant conversion events and UTM conventions.</p></article><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>03 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Ongoing optimization</h3><p>Search-term reviews, creative experiments, landing-page feedback, budget allocation and discussion of lead quality with your team.</p></article></div><p class="lf-editorial-note">Not every inquiry is a good lead. Where sales feedback is available, we look beyond platform-reported conversions to qualified inquiries, appointments and the cost of generating each one.</p><div class="lf-editorial-actions"><a class="lf-editorial-link" href="/contact/">Discuss your requirements ↗</a><a class="lf-editorial-link" href="/our-approach/">See our approach ↗</a></div></div></section>
<PerformanceShowcase />
<section class="lf-page-section" aria-labelledby="lf-paid-proof-heading"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">CAMPAIGN WORK / REAL PROJECT</p><h2 id="lf-paid-proof-heading">See the lead-generation system behind the ads.</h2><p>For Sonya Hair Braiding in Harlem, we combined Meta lead forms and call campaigns with CRM tracking and a booking journey.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/work/sonya-hair-braiding/">Explore the Sonya case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="lf-detail-card" style="min-height:0"><span class="lf-card-index">REPORTED META RESULTS</span><h3>256 Instant Form leads</h3><p>At $2.13 per form lead, alongside 94 Meta-reported call actions at $5.18 per action. These are campaign-platform results, not confirmed appointments.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">HOW WE WORK</p><h2>From audit to ongoing improvement.</h2><p>We prioritize lead quality, not vanity metrics.</p></div><ol class="lf-process"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Discover</h3><p>Review the offer, customer journey, market and current tracking.</p></div></li>
<li><span>02</span><div><h3>Build</h3><p>Plan audience, keywords, creatives and conversion paths.</p></div></li>
<li><span>03</span><div><h3>Launch</h3><p>Validate events and release campaigns with a controlled learning plan.</p></div></li>
<li><span>04</span><div><h3>Improve</h3><p>Review lead quality, conversion rates and the impact of follow-up.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<CampaignEvidence />
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>Questions worth asking.</h2></div><div class="lf-faq-list"><details><summary>Is Google Ads or Meta Ads better for lead generation?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Google Search tends to capture existing intent, while Meta can create or stimulate demand. The better channel depends on the offer, audience, market and budget.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do you guarantee a number of leads?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No responsible campaign can guarantee a specific result without testing and context. We focus on measurable execution and optimization.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can you work with my current website?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes. We can assess whether your current landing experience is fit for paid traffic and recommend focused improvements.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">CONNECTED SERVICES</p><h2>Better together.</h2></div><div class="lf-related"><a class="lf-related-link" href="/ad-creatives-content/"><span>Ad Creative Services</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
<a class="lf-related-link" href="/websites-funnels/"><span>Lead Generation Websites &amp; Funnels</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
<a class="lf-related-link" href="/crm-automation/"><span>CRM &amp; Marketing Automation Services</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-end-cta"><div class="container lf-cta-inner"><div><p class="section-kicker">LET'S TALK GROWTH</p><h2>Build a more reliable path to your next customer.</h2></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
